OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for role in #266m money
OL,4,Alaundering scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for eight years
OL,7,Ffor his role in helping to launder
OL,8,F#266m of criminal cash through a scrap
OL,9,Fjewellery firm.
OL,11,FSamir Jagirdar, 58, used his
OL,12,FLondon-based firm Pure Nines as a front
OL,13,Fto deliver cash to Fowler Oldfield in
OL,14,FBradford. The money was then used to
OL,15,Fbuy gold grain that was exported to
OL,16,FDubai with fake invoices.
OL,18,FWest Yorkshire Police said the
OL,19,Finvestigation into the racket was the
OL,20,Flargest into the laundering of criminal
OL,21,Fcash in UK legal history.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
